er-disappears-in-mice-after-new-mrna-immunotherapy</guid></item><item><title>斯坦福大学医学院主导的研究表明，抗癫痫药物可对抗侵袭性儿童脑肿瘤</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/anti-seizure-drug-fights-aggressive-childhood-brain-tumors-stanford-medicine-led-study-shows</link><description>斯坦福医疗保健提供最高水平的护理和同情心。 SHC 治疗癌症、心脏病、脑部疾病、初级保健问题等等。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/anti-seizure-drug-fights-aggressive-childhood-brain-tumors-stanford-medicine-led-study-shows2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 16:53:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/anti-seizure-drug-fights-aggressive-childhood-brain-tumors-stanford-medicine-led-study-shows</guid></item><item><title>小鼠多巴胺消耗揭示了潜在的多动症治疗目标</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/dopamine-depletion-in-mice-reveals-potential-adhd-treatment-target</link><description>研究人员从小鼠 D2 受体表达细胞中删除 NSF，导致纹状体细胞损失、多巴胺下降约 90% 以及 ADHD 样行为增加。激活 D2 受体和哌醋甲酯可减少多动和冲动。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/dopamine-depletion-in-mice-reveals-potential-adhd-treatment-target.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 16:38:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/dopamine-depletion-in-mice-reveals-potential-adhd-treatment-target</guid></item><item><title>科学家们设计了一种发光的乌贼。为什么这么难？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/scientists-engineered-a-glowing-cuttlefish-why-was-it-so-hard</link><description>头足类动物基因改造的突破为感知、大脑进化等新研究铺平了道路&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-engineered-a-glowing-cuttlefish-why-was-it-so-hard2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 16:23:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/scientists-engineered-a-glowing-cuttlefish-why-was-it-so-hard</guid></item><item><title>纤维蛋白样相关的中性粒细胞促进母胎界面的侵入性胎盘和中性粒细胞重编程</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/fibrinoid-associated-neutrophils-promote-invasive-placentation-and-neutrophil-reprogramming-at-the-maternal-fetal-interface</link><description>中性粒细胞在早期母胎界面处采取组织适应状态，支持滋养层侵袭。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/fibrinoid-associated-neutrophils-promote-invasive-placentation-and-neutrophil-reprogramming-at-the-maternal-fetal-interface2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 16:08:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/fibrinoid-associated-neutrophils-promote-invasive-placentation-and-neutrophil-reprogramming-at-the-maternal-fetal-interface</guid></item><item><title>机器或人工智能代理可以感到惊讶吗？帮助自主系统应对意外情况</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/can-a-machine-or-ai-agent-be-surprised-helping-autonomous-systems-respond-to-the-unexpected</link><description>假设您向 ChatGPT 提出了一个难倒它的问题，或者一辆 Waymo 车辆在路上遇到了异常情况，或者一家自动化工厂面临意外中断。大多数人都会意识到发生了意外的事情并做出相应的调整。对于机器来说，事情并不总是那么简单。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/can-a-machine-or-ai-agent-be-surprised-helping-autonomous-systems-respond-to-the-unexpected2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 15:53:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/can-a-machine-or-ai-agent-be-surprised-helping-autonomous-systems-respond-to-the-unexpected</guid></item><item><title>大卫·伍德论奇点原则</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/david-wood-on-the-singularity-principles</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/david-wood-on-the-singularity-principles.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 15:38:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/david-wood-on-the-singularity-principles</guid></item><item><title>用于高频生物电子学的香菇菌丝体可持续忆阻器</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/sustainable-memristors-from-shiitake-mycelium-for-high-frequency-bioelectronics</link><description>受大脑结构启发的神经形态计算在并行处理、内存存储和能源效率方面具有优势。然而，当前基于半导体的神经形态芯片需要稀土材料和昂贵的制造工艺，而神经类器官则需要复杂的生物反应器维护。在这项研究中，我们探索了香菇（ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog